## Aging Health Local Authoring, Audit & Blogger Publishing Workflow

This repository manages the custom **TDMag Blogger XML theme**, local HTML post drafts, VS Code snippets, and PowerShell build/validation tools for **[Aging Health](https://www.aginghealth.website/)** (authored by Tommy T. Douglas).

### Repository Structure

```text
├── .vscode/
│   └── tasks.json                 # VS Code build (Ctrl+Shift+B) & batch test tasks
├── posts/
│   └── <post-slug>.html           # Local HTML article drafts
├── post-preview-template.html     # Live Server wrapper with mock theme schema & inspector
├── build-blogger-post.ps1         # Single-post SEO/schema auditor, compiler & clipboard exporter
├── validate-jsonld.ps1            # Batch JSON-LD, citation & HTML section validator
└── theme/
    └── tdmag-aging-health.xml     # Custom Blogger Layout v3 XML template backup
